ding import NamedSharding, PartitionSpec as P, AxisType\n\nmesh = jax.make_mesh((jax.device_count(),), (\"x\",), (AxisType.Auto,))\nin_sharding = NamedSharding(mesh, P(\"x\", None))\nout_sharding = NamedSharding(mesh, P(None, \"x\"))\n\nA = jnp.zeros((64, 64))\nA = jax.device_put(A, in_sharding)\njax.block_until_ready(A)\n\n@jax.jit\ndef fn(A):\n    A = jax.lax.with_sharding_constraint(A, out_sharding)\n    return A\n\nout = fn(A)\njax.block_until_ready(out)\n```\n\nThe error is\n```\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/resnick/home/aochen/test/sharding/test_20260420_124314.py\", line 25, in <module>\n    jax.block_until_ready(out)\n  File \"/resnick/home/aochen/quantax_env/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/api.py\", line 2581, in block_until_ready\n    try_to_block(arrays[0])\n  File \"/resnick/home/aochen/quantax_env/lib/python3.11/site-packages/jax/_src/api.py\", line 2564, in try_to_block\n    return x.block_until_ready()\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\njax.errors.JaxRuntimeError: INTERNAL: NCCL operation ncclAlltoAll( send_contiguous->opaque(), recv_contiguous->opaque(), ToNcclCount(dtype, count), nccl_dtype, comm_, AsCudaStream(stream)) failed: unhandled system error (run with NCCL_DEBUG=INFO for details). Last NCCL warning(error) log entry (may be unrelated) ''.\nW0420 12:43:36.644361  582261 pjrt_client.cc:1604] WatchTasksAsync failed for task 0: UNAVAILABLE: Cancelling all calls\nAdditional GRPC error information from remote target coordination_service while calling /xla.coordination.CoordinationService/WatchTasks:\n:UNKNOWN:Error received from peer  {grpc_status:14, grpc_message:\"Cancelling all calls\"}\n```\n\nI also tried a slightly different function\n```python\n@jax.jit(out_shardings=out_sharding)\ndef fn(A):\n    return A\n```\nwhich gives the same error.\n\nThe error doesn't appear on\n- `jax <= v0.9.1`\n- single-process jobs\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.10.0\njaxlib: 0.10.